    "Cleanup13.21%,instructions3.26%,compiler phases2.45%and complete build2.68%improve, with both blocks faster. Slight RSS/footprint and other stage increases remain. Every source/bytecode/Object/complete metadata and full native executable byte matches; no scalar retirement or new program-runtime campaign is claimed.",
